  (text "--> BASIC POWER SHARING <--\nVCOM: Serial +5 volt feed, VBUS: PC Host +5 volt feed\n- VCC supplied via VBUS when connected to PC Host.\n- VCC supplied via VCOM when connected to Serial.\n- VCC supplied via VBUS even if VCOM is present."
